    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in <i>Tome of Fates</i>, an Adventure Gamebook: create, play, and share unique stories through the built-in story editor. Play solo or co-op with friends, craft epic narratives without any coding, then share them on the Steam Workshop for others to enjoy.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EDITOR - Story Creation, Simplified</h2></li></ul>Dive into the powerful yet intuitive story editor. This tool allows you to design branching narratives without any programming knowledge, making it easy to bring your imagination to life.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310150/extras/298e1737d164e6fd96ddabf6fb9c6779.avif?t=1753070055\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORKSHOP- Share Your Stories</h2></li></ul>Share your stories on Steam Workshop and discover new adventures from the community.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310150/extras/b15628043fe69dad8d531333a5a54917.avif?t=1753070055\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER - Co-op / Twitch viewer interaction</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't want to play alone? Our unique CO-OP system allows you and your chosen friends to vote on the path the story takes and what choices to make. Bit of a streamer? Use our Twitch Integration system to allow viewers to join in on the fun and influence your story! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310150/extras/9296afb533a333bcfd98237c7d99b718.avif?t=1753070055\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in <i>Tome of Fates</i>, an Adventure Gamebook: create, play, and share unique stories through the built-in story editor. Play solo or co-op with friends, craft epic narratives without any coding, then share them on the Steam Workshop for others to enjoy.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EDITOR - Story Creation, Simplified</h2></li></ul>Dive into the powerful yet intuitive story editor. This tool allows you to design branching narratives without any programming knowledge, making it easy to bring your imagination to life.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310150/extras/298e1737d164e6fd96ddabf6fb9c6779.avif?t=1753070055\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORKSHOP- Share Your Stories</h2></li></ul>Share your stories on Steam Workshop and discover new adventures from the community.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310150/extras/b15628043fe69dad8d531333a5a54917.avif?t=1753070055\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER - Co-op / Twitch viewer interaction</h2></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't want to play alone? Our unique CO-OP system allows you and your chosen friends to vote on the path the story takes and what choices to make. Bit of a streamer? Use our Twitch Integration system to allow viewers to join in on the fun and influence your story! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310150/extras/9296afb533a333bcfd98237c7d99b718.avif?t=1753070055\" /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Adventure Gamebook: Dive into an interactive experience where you can create, play, and share your own unique stories. Use the intuitive story editor to craft narratives without coding, explore them solo or in co-op with friends, and share them on the Workshop for everyone to enjoy.",
